### 1️⃣ Login (to get Access Token)
POST http://localhost:3030/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your_email@example.com",
  "password": "YourPassword@123"
}
###
# Copy the "accessToken" from the login response below and paste it in the Authorization header for all requests

### 2️⃣ Create a New Task
POST http://localhost:3030/v1/tasks/create
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "title": "Complete Project Report",
  "description": "Complete the project report and submit before Friday"
}
###

### 3️⃣ Get All Tasks (for logged-in user)
GET http://localhost:3030/v1/tasks/all
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### 4️⃣ Get Task by ID
# Replace 1 with your real task ID
GET http://localhost:3030/v1/tasks/1
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### 5️⃣ Update Task (Title, Description, or Status)
PATCH http://localhost:3030/v1/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "title": "Updated Report Task",
  "description": "Include executive summary and references",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}
###

### 6️⃣ Update Only Task Status (Kanban style)
PATCH http://localhost:3030/v1/tasks/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "status": "DONE"
}
###

### 7️⃣ Get Tasks by Status
GET http://localhost:3030/v1/tasks/status/TODO
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### 8️⃣ Delete Task
DELETE http://localhost:3030/v1/tasks/1
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

# ===============================
# 👥 COLLABORATOR ROUTES
# ===============================

### 9️⃣ Add Collaborator to Task
POST http://localhost:3030/v1/tasks/2/collaborators
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "userId": 3,
  "role": "EDITOR"
}
###

### 🔟 Get All Collaborators for a Task
GET http://localhost:3030/v1/tasks/2/collaborators
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###

### 1️⃣1️⃣ Remove a Collaborator from Task
DELETE http://localhost:3030/v1/tasks/2/collaborators/5
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
###
